    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just seems like it's on my face though, i dont feel anything wrong with my arms or legs. i havent had any trouble walking or speaking weirdly as far as i can tell. so if it's just the face, it's probably just that nerve thing right? like bell's palsy? i'd rather not go to the er if i don't have to, it's always such a huge hassle.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
